 New Delhi, India</strong></span>\n    <span class=\"job-date\"><strong>2010 - 2020</strong></span>\n  </div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Directed comprehensive <strong>stakeholder management</strong> and client operations initiatives, scaling enterprise accounts and driving a 25% revenue increase in the HORECA sector.</li>\n    <li>Implemented robust <strong>data validation</strong> tracking and analytical reporting systems, enhancing targeting accuracy and accelerating overall client customer acquisition metrics by 30%.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>", "certifications_html": "<div class=\"cert-row\"><span class=\"cert-name\">Coursera - Google Advanced Data Analytics</span><span class=\"cert-date\">In Progress</span></div>\n<div class=\"cert-row\"><span class=\"cert-name\">Coursera - Tableau Business Intelligence Analyst Professional Certificate</span><span class=\"cert-date\">May 2025</span></div>", "education_html": "<div class=\"edu-row\"><span>University of Delhi, B.Comm(Hons.)</span><span class=\"edu-date\">2013 \u2013 2016</span></div>", "hobbies_html": "<div class=\"hobbies-line\">Practicing Buddhism &nbsp;|&nbsp; Automating life with n8n &nbsp;|&nbsp; Growing Mushrooms</div>"}, "clSections": {"hasStoredCl": false, "salutation_html": "<p class=\"salutation\">Dear Hiring Manager at Stripe,</p>", "para1_hook_html": "<p>I am writing to apply for the Payments Analyst role at Stripe. With over five years of hands-on experience building reliable SQL and Python reporting pipelines, designing executive Tableau dashboards, and partnering with product and operations leaders, I am eager to contribute immediately to Stripe's data and analytics goals.</p>", "para2_stewardship_html": "<p>Throughout my career across high-volume operational and business intelligence environments, I have focused on turning complex, fragmented datasets into clear, trustworthy decision frameworks. Whether automating recurring ETL workflows or establishing governed KPI definitions across teams, I prioritize data a