g</strong> presentations and training modules that enforced strict adherence to operating rigor and compliance guidelines for 200+ team members.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\">\n    <span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Founder | Creative Director, Maerke Stratcomm \u2013 New Delhi, India</strong></span>\n    <span class=\"job-date\"><strong>Jan 2010 \u2013 Mar 2020</strong></span>\n  </div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Facilitated detailed <strong>contract review</strong> and vendor negotiations to protect profit margins and accelerate enterprise revenue growth across 50+ client accounts.</li>\n    <li>Optimized end-to-end operational workflows and resource allocation, successfully scaling agency output by 35% through enhanced <strong>operating rigor</strong>.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>", "certifications_html": "<div class=\"cert-row\"><span class=\"cert-name\">Coursera - Tableau Business Intelligence Analyst Professional Certificate</span><span class=\"cert-date\">May 2025</span></div>\n<div class=\"cert-row\"><span class=\"cert-name\">Coursera - Google Advanced Data Analytics</span><span class=\"cert-date\">In Progress</span></div>\n<div class=\"cert-row\"><span class=\"cert-name\">Coursera - Google Project Management</span><span class=\"cert-date\">In Progress</span></div>", "education_html": "<div class=\"edu-row\"><span>University of Delhi, B.Comm(Hons.)</span><span class=\"edu-date\">2013 \u2013 2016</span></div>", "hobbies_html": "<div class=\"hobbies-line\">Practicing Buddhism &nbsp;|&nbsp; Automating life with n8n &nbsp;|&nbsp; Growing Mushrooms</div>"}, "clSections": {"hasStoredCl": true, "salutation_html": "<p class=\"salutation\"><strong>To the Hiring Team at Stripe,</strong></p>", "para1_hook_html": "<p>What caught my attention about the <strong>Financial Analyst, Business F&S</strong> role at Stripe is how directly the job description targets the messy reality of scaling financial operations: establishing clean, consistent reporting foundations and bringing rigorous standardization to opex, headcount, and month-end workflows. Having spent the last several years translating complex operational data into reliable financial insights\u2014preceded by a decade running my own commercial agency\u2014I know that most strategic friction happens when data hygiene breaks down between disparate systems. That operational intersection is precisely where I do my best work.</p>", "para2_stewardship_html": "<p>When I am not profiling millions of records or building reporting dashboards, I spend my spare time on my terrace in Gurugram growing mushrooms and automating personal workflows with <strong>n8n</strong>. Cultivating mushrooms in North India's climate isn't a romantic hobby; it is an exercise in strict variable control\u2014if humidity, airflow, or substrate prep drifts even slightly, the batch fails. I bring that same rigorous stewardship to financial systems, whether I am building <strong>standardized dashboards and data packs</strong> for leadership, running opex budget-versus-actual analysis, or driving <strong>cross-system data integrity</strong> across planning tools.</p>", "para3_impact_story_html": "<p>Furthermore, I believe analysis is only as useful as the operational fix it drives. During my time at Concentrix, our workforce data kept flagging quality drops in new cohorts, and simply sending leadership another dashboard wasn't fixing it. I dug into the operational funnel, traced the disconnect between initial screening and floor realities, and made the case to embed our training team directly into the recruitment workflow. That structural adjustment drove an <strong>84% improvement in hire quality</strong>\u2014similar to how I now partner across <strong>4+ engineering and business groups</strong> at Highspring India to cut manual reporting overhead by 40% and resolve hundreds of data consistency issues.</p>", "para4_resilience_html": "<p>While my background covers strong ground across 