=\"job-title\"><strong>Founder | Creative Director, Maerke Stratcomm \u2013 New Delhi, India</strong></span><span class=\"job-date\"><strong>June 2010 \u2013 July 2020</strong></span></div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Directed <strong>commercial analytics</strong>, pricing strategy, and market segmentation for 15+ B2B and retail clients, driving a 30% increase in customer acquisition.</li>\n    <li>Implemented <strong>funnel performance tracking</strong> and ROI attribution models across regional distribution channels, expanding HORECA and enterprise account revenue by 25%.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>", "certifications_html": "<div class=\"cert-row\"><span class=\"cert-name\">Coursera - Tableau Business Intelligence Analyst Professional Certificate</span><span class=\"cert-date\">May 2025</span></div>\n<div class=\"cert-row\"><span class=\"cert-name\">Coursera - Google Advanced Data Analytics</span><span class=\"cert-date\">In Progress</span></div>\n<div class=\"cert-row\"><span class=\"cert-name\">Coursera - Google Project Management</span><span class=\"cert-date\">In Progress</span></div>", "education_html": "<div class=\"edu-row\"><span>University of Delhi, B.Comm(Hons.)</span><span class=\"edu-date\">2013 \u2013 2016</span></div>", "hobbies_html": "<div class=\"hobbies-line\">Practicing Buddhism &nbsp;|&nbsp; Automating life with n8n &nbsp;|&nbsp; Growing Mushrooms</div>"}, "clSections": {"hasStoredCl": true, "salutation_html": "<div class=\"letter-meta\">\n  <div class=\"letter-date\">September 29, 2026</div>\n  <div class=\"recipient-block\">\n    <div>Hiring Manager</div>\n    <div>United</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"subject-line\"><strong>Re: Application for Analyst - Data Scientist</strong></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"salutation\">Dear Hiring Manager,</p>", "para1_hook_html": "<p>I am writing to apply for the Analyst - Data Scientist role at United. What stood out to me in the job description is the focus on building practical data workflows and turning messy problems into clear solutions. Before spending the last five years in data analytics, I ran my own small business for ten years. That mix taught me how much time teams lose when numbers do not match across different tools. Fixing those gaps between business needs and technical teams is the part of the job I enjoy most.</p>", "para2_stewardship_html": "<p>Outside of writing Python code and building models, I spend my free time on my terrace in Gurugram growing mushrooms and automating small daily tasks with n8n. Growing mushrooms in North India's weather is not a fancy hobby. It comes down to watching basic details closely. If moisture or airflow slips even a little, the whole batch fails. I bring that same habit to my work when I check data quality, test workflows, or build reliable applications that leaders rely on.</p>", "para3_impact_story_html": "<p>I also believe analysis is only useful when it solves a real problem on the ground. At Concentrix, our hiring data showed that new joiners were struggling once they started work. Sending another dashboard to management was not fixing the issue. I looked closely at the hiring steps and worked with leadership to bring our training team directly into the interview stage. That simple change improved hire quality by 84%. In my current role at Highspring India, I use the same practical approach across four engineering teams to automate recurring reports and cut manual work by 40%.</p>", "para4_resilience_html": "<p>My day-to-day work covers SQL, Python, and working closely with business and tech teams. If your team uses an internal tool I have not worked with yet, I learn new systems quickly. Practical challenges early in my career taught me how to stay resourceful and get things done without hand-holding. When I take ownership of a task, you will not have to follow up twice.</p>", "para5_closing_html": "<p>I would welcome the chance to bring this steady, practical approach to your team. Thank you for your time and consideration, and I look forward to speaking with you soon.</p>"}, "index": 8, "role": "Analyst - Data Scientist", "category": "operations_strategy", "jobUrl": "https://careers.united.com/us/en/c/corporate-jobs", "jdSnippet": "Description\nUnited's Digital Technology team is comprised of many talented individuals all working together with cutting-edge technology to build the best airline in the history of aviation. Our team designs, develops and maintains massively scaling technology solutions brought t", "lastUpdate": "2026-10-07 15:15 IST", "referralName": "", "referralContact": "", "referralStatus": "", "resumeFileId": "1b8O9Z4fjzyQ1V9huamQzT3FROQgdI-P0", "resumeUrl": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID", "clFileId": "134_-e_1KRFXZGy8vzMJsvBw2VMDOadLU", "clUrl": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_DRIVE_ID", "sections": {"summary": "<p>Senior Data &amp; Business Analyst combining extensive enterprise data analytics and operations intelligence experience with a strong foundation in commercial strategy and stakeholder consulting. Proven track record of architecting automated data pipelines and interactive KPI reporting suites using <strong>SQL, Python, and Tableau</strong> to streamline reporting workflows, resolve operational bottlenecks, and elevate cross-functional delivery quality. Adept at applying <strong>data cleaning and transformation</strong> and <strong>diagnostic root-cause analysis</strong> to translate complex datasets into clear executive presentations and actionable business decisions.</p>", "skills_html": "<ul>\n  <li><strong>Data Analysis &amp; Database Management:</strong> SQL (Postgresql, Mysql, Bigquery), Python (Pandas, Numpy), Excel, Api/data Integration, Database Management, R, Jupyter Notebooks</li>\n  <li><strong>Business Intelligence &amp; Visualization:</strong> Dashboard/report Automation, Executive Presentations, KPI Scorecard Design, Tableau, Interactive Dashboards, Narrative Insight Synthesis</li>\n  <li><strong>Data Governance &amp; Process Optimization:</strong> Data Cleaning &amp; Wrangling, Data Transformation, Quality Assurance, Automating Workflows (n8n), Root-cause &amp; Variance Analysis, Identifying Improvement Opportunities</li>\n  <li><strong>Stakeholder Collaboration &amp; Strategy:</strong> Stakeholder Communication, Cross-functional Teamwork, Critical Thinking &amp; Problem Solving, Business Acumen, Consulting &amp; Client Engagement, Training &amp; Mentorship</li>\n</ul>", "exp1_bullets": "<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\"><span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Sr. Data Analyst, Highspring India \u2013 Gurugram, India</strong></span><span class=\"job-date\"><strong>Oct 2025 - Present</strong></span></div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Spearheaded end-to-end <strong>SQL data modelling</strong> and pipeline optimization across 1M+ monthly records using Python and BigQuery, cutting manual reporting overhead by 40%.</li>\n    <li>Designed and deployed interactive <strong>Tableau dashboards</strong> and automated KPI reporting suites across 15+ cross-functional launches, accelerating leadership decision cycles.</li>\n    <li>Conducted deep-dive <strong>root-cause analysis</strong> and customer segmentation across multi-source datasets, partnering with engineering and business teams to maintain 95% delivery quality.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\"><span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Lead Trainer, Concentrix Daksh \u2013 Gurugram, India</strong></span><span class=\"job-date\"><strong>April 2022 \u2013 Aug 2025</strong></span></div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Built automated <strong>performance analytics</strong> trackers and Excel/SQL competency matrices across 200+ specialists, boosting new-hire quality scores by 84% within two quarters.</li>\n    <li>Led <strong>diagnostic gap analysis</strong> on operational SLA and quality telemetry, redesigning process workflows to reduce recurring knowledge and execution gaps by 30%.</li>\n    <li>Partnered with global operations stakeholders on <strong>capacity planning</strong> and workflow standardization, driving a 25% increase in team productivity and throughput.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\"><span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Customer Support Representative, Concentrix Daksh \u2013 Gurugram, India</strong></span><span class=\"job-date\"><strong>Jan 2021 \u2013 Mar 2022</strong></span></div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Resolved escalated consumer inquiries by utilizing <strong>CRM telemetry</strong> and historical performance metrics, accelerating ticket resolution speed by 35% across high-volume queues.</li>\n    <li>Analyzed user interaction trends to identify recurring <strong>service bottlenecks</strong>, partnering with operations leads to streamline workflows and boost customer satisfaction.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\"><span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Founder | Creative Director, Maerke Stratcomm \u2013 New Delhi, India</strong></span><span class=\"job-date\"><strong>June 2010 \u2013 July 2020</strong></span></div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Directed <strong>commercial analytics</strong>, pricing strategy, and market segmentation for 15+ B2B and retail clients, driving a 30% increase in customer acquisition.</li>\n    <li>Implemented <strong>funnel performance tracking</strong> and ROI attribution models across regional distribution channels, expanding HORECA and enterprise account revenue by 25%.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>", "exp2_bullets": "", "exp3_bullets": ""}, "clHtml": "<div class=\"letter-meta\">\n  <div class=\"letter-date\">September 29, 2026</div>\n  <div class=\"recipient-block\">\n    <div>Hiring Manager</div>\n    <div>United</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"subject-line\"><strong>Re: Application for Analyst - Data Scientist</strong></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"salutation\">Dear Hiring Manager,</p>\n<p>I am writing to apply for the Analyst - Data Scientist role at United. What stood out to me in the job description is the focus on building practical data workflows and turning messy problems into clear solutions. Before spending the last five years in data analytics, I ran my own small business for ten years. That mix taught me how much time teams lose when numbers do not match across different tools. Fixing those gaps between business needs and technical teams is the part of the job I enjoy most.</p>\n<p>Outside of writing Python code and building models, I spend my free time on my terrace in Gurugram growing mushrooms and automating small daily tasks with n8n. Growing mushrooms in North India's weather is not a fancy hobby. It comes down to watching basic details closely. If moisture or airflow slips even a little, the whole batch fails. I bring that same habit to my work when I check data quality, test workflows, or build reliable applications that leaders rely on.</p>\n<p>I also believe analysis is only useful when it solves a real problem on the ground. At Concentrix, our hiring data showed that new joiners were struggling once they started work. Sending another dashboard to management was not fixing the issue. I looked closely at the hiring steps and worked with leadership to bring our training team directly into the interview stage. That simple change improved hire quality by 84%. In my current role at Highspring India, I use the same practical approach across four engineering teams to automate recurring reports and cut manual work by 40%.</p>\n<p>My day-to-day work covers SQL, Python, and working closely with business and tech teams. If your team uses an internal tool I have not worked with yet, I learn new systems quickly. Practical challenges early in my career taught me how to stay resourceful and get things done without hand-holding. When I take ownership of a task, you will not have to follow up twice.</p>\n<p>I would welcome the chance to bring this steady, practical approach to your team. Thank you for your time and co