ment Opportunities, Automating Workflows (n8n), Root-cause &amp; Variance Analysis</li>\n  <li><strong>Stakeholder Collaboration &amp; Strategy:</strong> Critical Thinking &amp; Problem Solving, Stakeholder Communication, Cross-functional Teamwork, Business Acumen, Consulting &amp; Client Engagement, Training &amp; Mentorship</li>\n</ul>", "experience_html": "<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\"><span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Sr. Data Analyst, Highspring India \u2013 Gurugram, India</strong></span><span class=\"job-date\"><strong>Oct 2025 - Present</strong></span></div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Spearheaded end-to-end <strong>SQL data modelling</strong> and pipeline optimization across 1M+ monthly records using Python and BigQuery, cutting manual reporting overhead by 40%.</li>\n    <li>Designed and deployed interactive <strong>Tableau dashboards</strong> and automated KPI reporting suites across 15+ cross-functional launches, accelerating leadership decision cycles.</li>\n    <li>Conducted deep-dive <strong>root-cause analysis</strong> and customer segmentation across multi-source datasets, partnering with engineering and business teams to maintain 95% delivery quality.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\"><span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Lead Trainer, Concentrix Daksh \u2013 Gurugram, India</strong></span><span class=\"job-date\"><strong>April 2022 \u2013 Aug 2025</strong></span></div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Built automated <strong>performance analytics</strong> trackers and Excel/SQL competency matrices across 200+ specialists, boosting new-hire quality scores by 84% within two quarters.</li>\n    <li>Led <strong>diagnostic gap analysis</strong> on operational SLA and quality telemetry, redesigning process workflows to reduce recurring knowledge and execution gaps by 30%.</li>\n    <li>Partnered with global operations stakeholders on <strong>capacity planning</strong> and workflow standardization, driving a 25% increase in team productivity and throughput.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\"><span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Customer Support Representative, Concentrix Daksh \u2013 Gurugram, India</strong></span><span class=\"job-date\"><strong>Jan 2021 \u2013 Mar 2022</strong></span></div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Resolved escalated consumer inquiries by utilizing <strong>CRM telemetry</strong> and historical performance metrics, accelerating ticket resolution speed by 35% across high-volume queues.</li>\n    <li>Analyzed user interaction trends to identify recurring <strong>service bottlenecks</strong>, partnering with operations leads to streamline workflows and boost customer satisfaction.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"job-block\">\n  <div class=\"job-header\"><span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Founder | Creative Director, Maerke Stratcomm \u2013 New Delhi, India</strong></span><span class=\"job-date\"><strong>June 2010 \u2013 July 2020</strong></span></div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Directed <strong>commercial analytics</strong>, pricing strategy, and market segmentation for 15+ B2B and retail clients, driving a 30% increase in customer acquisition.</li>\n    <li>Implemented <strong>funnel performance tracking</strong> and ROI attribution models across regional distribution channels, expanding HORECA and enterprise account revenue by 25%.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>", "certifications_html": "<div class=\"cert-row\"><span class=\"cert-name\">Coursera - Tableau Business Intelligence Analyst Professional Certificate</span><span class=\"cert-date\">May 2025</span></div>\n<div class=\"cert-row\"><span class=\"cert-name\">Coursera - Google Advanced Data Analytics</span><span class=\"cert-date\">In Progress</span></div>\n<div class=\"cert-row\"><span class=\"cert-name\">Coursera - Google Project Management</span><span class=\"cert-date\">In Progress</span></div>", "education_html": "<div class=\"edu-row\"><span>University of Delhi, B.Comm(Hons.)</span><span class=\"edu-date\">2013 \u2013 2016</span></div>", "hobbies_html": "<div class=\"hobbies-line\">Practicing Buddhism &nbsp;|&nbsp; Automating life with n8n &nbsp;|&nbsp; Growing Mushrooms</div>"}, "clSections": {"hasStoredCl": true, "salutation_html": "<p class=\"salutation\"><strong>To the Hiring Team at United,</strong></p>", "para1_hook_html": "<p>What caught my attention about the <strong>Analyst - Catering Systems Administrator</strong> role at United is how directly it addresses the behind-the-scenes precision required to keep a massive operational network moving. Ensuring accurate data, vendor payments, and seamless system configurations across flight catering requires an analytical eye that respects how small data errors compound at scale. Having spent the last several years turning messy operational workflows into clean data models and structured BI\u2014preceded by a decade running my own commercial operations and B2B sales\u2014I know that logistical reliability lives or dies in the details of the database.</p>", "para2_stewardship_html": "<p>When I am not writing <strong>SQL</strong> queries, mapping workflows, or auditing data consistency, I spend my spare time on my terrace in Gurugram growing mushrooms and automating personal workflows with <strong>n8n</strong>. Cultivating mushrooms in North India's climate is an exercise in strict variable control\u2014if humidity, airflow, or substrate prep drifts even slightly, the batch fails. I bring that exact same practical stewardship to enterprise systems, whether I am managing <strong>data integrity and error resolution</strong>, configuring system frameworks, or ensuring meticulous accuracy in daily operations.</p>", "para3_impact_story_html": "<p>Furthermore, I believe data management is only as useful as the operational alignment it drives. During my time at Concentrix, our workforce data kept flagging quality drops in new training cohorts, and simply sending leadership another dashboard wasn\u2019t solving it. I dug into the recruitment funnel, traced the disconnect between screening and floor realities, and successfully advocated to embed our training team directly into the hiring workflow\u2014a structural shift that drove an <strong>84% improvement in hire quality</strong>. I apply that same cross-functional problem-solving today at Highspring India, partnering across <strong>4+ engineering and business groups</strong> to cut manual reporting overhead by 40% and resolve hundreds of data consistency gaps.</p>", "para4_resilience_html": "<p>While my technical foundation across SQL, Python, and data governance is robust, I understand that adapting to proprietary airline and catering management architectures requires a steep learning curve on day one. Early in my career, navigating real-world constraints taught me how to strip away noise, focus on fundamentals, and become a <strong>dedicated learner with a sharp focus</strong> on operational excellence. Above all, I am <strong>unconditionally dependable</strong>\u2014when I take ownership of a system or dataset, you will never have to chase me to see it through.</p>", "para5_closing_html": "<p>I would value the chance to bring this grounded ownership, rigorous attention to detail, and steady execution to your team at United.</p><p>Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to discussing how my experience can support your upcoming data and systems initiatives.</p>"}, "index": 10, "role": "Analyst - Catering Systems Administrator", "category": "operations_strategy", "jobUrl": "https://careers.united.com/us/en/c/corporate-jobs", "jdSnippet": "Description\nJob Overview and Responsibilities\n\nThe Analyst - Catering Systems Administrator plays a critical role in maintaining the integrity and accuracy of catering data across United\u2019s systems and tools. This position supports business partners in delivering seamless catering", "lastUpdate": "2026-10-07 15:15 IST", "referralName": "", "referralContact"