ource datasets, partnering with engineering and business teams to maintain 95% delivery quality.</li></ul></div><div class=\"job-block\"><div class=\"job-header\"><span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Lead Trainer, Concentrix Daksh \u2013 Gurugram, India</strong></span><span class=\"job-date\"><strong>April 2022 \u2013 Aug 2025</strong></span></div><ul><li>Built automated <strong>performance analytics</strong> trackers and Excel/SQL competency matrices across 200+ specialists, boosting new-hire quality scores by 84% within two quarters.</li><li>Led <strong>diagnostic gap analysis</strong> on operational SLA and quality telemetry, redesigning process workflows to reduce recurring knowledge and execution gaps by 30%.</li><li>Partnered with global operations stakeholders on <strong>capacity planning</strong> and workflow standardization, driving a 25% increase in team productivity and throughput.</li></ul></div><div class=\"job-block\"><div class=\"job-header\"><span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Customer Support Representative, Concentrix Daksh \u2013 Gurugram, India</strong></span><span class=\"job-date\"><strong>Jan 2021 \u2013 Mar 2022</strong></span></div><ul><li>Resolved escalated consumer inquiries by utilizing <strong>CRM telemetry</strong> and historical performance metrics, accelerating ticket resolution speed by 35% across high-volume queues.</li><li>Analyzed user interaction trends to identify recurring <strong>service bottlenecks</strong>, partnering with operations leads to streamline workflows and boost customer satisfaction.</li></ul></div><div class=\"job-block\"><div class=\"job-header\"><span class=\"job-title\"><strong>Founder | Creative Director, Maerke Stratcomm \u2013 New Delhi, India</strong></span><span class=\"job-date\"><strong>June 2010 \u2013 July 2020</strong></span></div><ul><li>Directed <strong>commercial analytics</strong>, pricing strategy, and market segmentation for 15+ B2B and retail clients, driving a 30% increase in customer acquisition.</li><li>Implemented <strong>funnel performance tracking</strong> and ROI attribution models across regional distribution channels, expanding HORECA and enterprise account revenue by 25%.</li></ul></div>", "exp2_bullets": "", "exp3_bullets": ""}, "clHtml": "<div class=\"letter-meta\">\n  <div class=\"letter-date\">September 29, 2026</div>\n  <div class=\"recipient-block\">\n    <div>Hiring Team</div><div>United</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"subject-line\"><strong>Subject: Application for the Analyst - Predictive Safety Analytics Role</strong></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"salutation\">Dear Hiring Manager,</p>\n<p>I am writing to apply for the Analyst - Predictive Safety Analytics role at United. What stood out to me in the job description is the focus on building predictive data workflows and turning safety data into clear insights. Before spending the last five years in data analytics, I ran my own small business for ten years. That mix taught me how much time teams lose when numbers do not match across different tools. Fixing those gaps between business teams and technical engineering is the part of the job I enjoy most.</p>\n<p>Outside of writing SQL queries and building Tableau dashboards, I spend my free time on my terrace in Gurugram growing mushrooms and automating small daily tasks with n8n. Growing mushrooms in North India weather is not a fancy hobby. It comes down to watching basic details closely. If moisture or airflow slips even a little, the whole batch fails. I bring that same habit to my work when I check data quality, map workflows, or build safety reports that leaders rely on.</p>\n<p>I also believe analysis is only useful when it solves a real problem on the ground. At Concentrix, our hiring data showed that new joiners were struggling once they started work. Sending another dashboard to management was not fixing the issue. I looked closely at the hiring steps and worked with leadership to bring our training team directly into the interview stage.